    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are you doing...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん。仲直りの印に
&lt;Hisui&gt;を年上として
尊敬してみようかと思ってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, well since we made up,
I thought maybe I should start treating
&lt;Hisui&gt; more like a brother-figure.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……それに、いつか本当の
お兄さんになるかも知れないしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, one day he might
actually be my brother too, in a way...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お兄ちゃんが……
&lt;Shing&gt;のお兄ちゃんに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How would my brother...
become your brother...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……その妄想、一回ごとに
にー、さん発
ぶん殴るからな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Every "brother" that comes out your mouth
comes with a free sock to the face, got it?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あうう、わかりましたぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oww, undershtood...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
